an’s capital, so after cancelling paired negations, this conjunct becomes\n  \\[\n  [\\neg(\\neg T\\land F)\\land(\\neg T\\land F)]\n  \\lor\n  \\neg[\\neg(\\neg F\\land T)\\lor(T\\lor\\neg F)]\n  =(T\\land F)\\lor\\neg[F\\lor(T\\lor T)]=F.\n  \\]\n  Hence **(A) is false**.\n\n- **(B):** It has the conjunct “The capital of Armenia is Gyumri.” This is false—the capital is Yerevan. Hence **(B) is false**.\n\n- **(C):** Let \\(X\\) denote the complicated expression immediately conjoined with the explicit `False`. After cancelling paired negations, (C) is\n  \\[\n  \\neg\\bigl[((X\\land F)\\lor\\neg T)\\lor\\neg(-21\\le-10)\\bigr]\n  \\land\\left(9+\\frac59>-5\\right).\n  \\]\n  Since \\(-21\\le-10\\) and \\(9+\\frac59>-5\\) are both true, this equals\n  \\[\n  \\neg[(F\\lor F)\\lor F]\\land T=T.\n  \\]\n\n- **(D):** Its final conjunct is \\(5-\\frac92\\le-10\\), namely \\(\\frac12\\le-10\\), which is false.\n\n- **(E):** Its final conjunct is\n  \\[\n  5(-7)+4(2)>(-8)(-3),\\qquad -27>24,\n  \\]\n  which is false.\n\nFinal answer: **(C)**."}],"phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":"24h","reasoning":{"context":"all_turns","effort":"medium","mode":"standard","summary":null},"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"default","store":false,"temperature":1,"text":{"format":{"type":"text"},"verbosity":"medium"},"tool_choice":"auto","tool_usage":{"image_gen":{"input_tokens":0,"input_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"total_tokens":0},"web_search":{"num_requests":0}},"tools":[],"top_logprobs":0,"top_p":0.98,"truncation":"disabled","usage":{"input_tokens":1408,"input_tokens_details":{"cache_write_tokens":0,"cached_tokens":1405},"output_tokens":1246,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":778},"total_tokens":2654},"user":null,"metadata":{}}
